#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:122
msgid ""
"The saved key is hidden. Leave this as it is to keep it, or paste a "
"different key over it to replace it."
msgstr ""
"The saved key is hidden. Leave this as it is to keep it, or paste a "
"different key over it to replace it."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:215
msgid ""
"Save an API key and endpoint first, then this will show when that key "
"expires."
msgstr ""
"Save an API key and endpoint first, then this will show when that key "
"expires."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:228
msgid ""
"This API key works, but the account has no access to that company — nothing "
"is syncing."
msgstr ""
"This API key works, but the account has no access to that company — nothing "
"is syncing."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:232
msgid ""
"Kledo accepted the key and then refused the request. Pasting a new key from "
"the same account will not help. Check that the account still belongs to the "
"company, or save a key made for the right company."
msgstr ""
"Kledo accepted the key and then refused the request. Pasting a new key from "
"the same account will not help. Check that the account still belongs to the "
"company, or save a key made for the right company."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:239
msgid "This API key is no longer valid — nothing is syncing."
msgstr "This API key is no longer valid — nothing is syncing."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:243
msgid ""
"Kledo refused it. It has either expired or been replaced by a newer login. "
"Paste a current API key above and save."
msgstr ""
"Kledo refused it. It has either expired or been replaced by a newer login. "
"Paste a current API key above and save."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:253
msgid ""
"Kledo could not be reached for this, so the expiry date is unknown right "
"now. It will be retried automatically."
msgstr ""
"Kledo could not be reached for this, so the expiry date is unknown right "
"now. It will be retried automatically."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-configure.php:254
