msgid "Sales Order Link"
msgstr "Sales Order Link"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:229
msgid ""
"How an invoice relates back to the Kledo sales order the same WooCommerce "
"order already created. Both settings below are inert unless linking is on — "
"closing is something Kledo does to a sales order the invoice is attached to, "
"so there is nothing to close without the attachment."
msgstr ""
"How an invoice relates back to the Kledo sales order the same WooCommerce "
"order already created. Both settings below are inert unless linking is on — "
"closing is something Kledo does to a sales order the invoice is attached to, "
"so there is nothing to close without the attachment."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:234
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:250
msgid "Link Invoice to Sales Order"
msgstr "Link Invoice to Sales Order"

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:238
msgid ""
"Record each invoice against the Kledo sales order it came from, so the sales "
"order counts those quantities as billed. Turn it off and the invoice stands "
"alone, leaving the sales order untouched — and the setting below stops "
"applying."
msgstr ""
"Record each invoice against the Kledo sales order it came from, so the sales "
"order counts those quantities as billed. Turn it off and the invoice stands "
"alone, leaving the sales order untouched — and the setting below stops "
"applying."

#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:243
msgid "Close Sales Order When Invoiced"
msgstr "Close Sales Order When Invoiced"

#. translators: %s: the name of the setting this one depends on, wrapped in <strong>.
#: includes/admin/screen/class-wc-kledo-invoice.php:249
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Requires %s above to be on; without it this setting does nothing. Kledo "
"closes a sales order once every quantity is billed — the same as invoicing "
"from the sales order in Kledo. Turn this off to close it yourself, though "
"Kledo closes it anyway the next time it recalculates that order."
msgstr ""
"Requires %s above to be on; without it this setting does nothing. Kledo "
"closes a sales order once every quantity is billed — the same as invoicing "
"from the sales order in Kledo. Turn this off to close it yourself, though "
